1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Building something you can't be there for every day?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
A house, a family building,
a community project.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,000
You need to know what's really done on site,
stage by stage, and where the money goes.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Plotwatch lets you oversee it from anywhere,
with evidence you can trust.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Brice is overseeing a five-storey residence
in Yaoundé.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Plotwatch shows him the build stage by stage,
and what needs him now.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Every photo is taken in the app,
right on the site.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Plotwatch checks it was really taken on the plot,
and when.

9
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:48,000
If it was,
the photo is marked Verified.

10
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,000
When something doesn't match, Plotwatch says so.

11
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:58,000
This photo is only partly verified: the phone
couldn't tell its location precisely enough.

12
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:04,000
When the site manager submits a stage,
Brice is notified at once.

13
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:10,000
He approves it,
or sends it back with a comment.

14
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:17,000
The site manager works from his phone.
He follows each stage's checklist, takes the photos,

15
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:24,000
posts news from the site, and confirms
when the money for the work reaches him.

16
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Every payment sent to the site, and every expense
paid from it, is recorded with its receipt,

17
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:36,000
and nothing can be changed afterwards.

18
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Plotwatch shows how much was released for the project,
what has been spent and what is left.

19
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:51,500
Plotwatch is built with Flutter and Serverpod:
live streams, scheduled tasks,

20
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:55,000
verified uploads and authentication,
on Serverpod Cloud.

21
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Try it at plotwatch.serverpod.space.
